son","person_id":"wwo_a4z_14d","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-047-sun-quan:p040:m0183","surface":"劉曄","start":183,"end":185,"kind":"person","person_id":"6iz_lm5_o4w","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-047-sun-quan","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-047","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-047-sun-quan-ws2602668"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-lusu:line043","text":"　　劉子揚與肅友善，遺肅書，曰：「方今天下豪傑並起，吾子姿才，尤宜今日。急還迎老母，無事滯於東城。近鄭寶者，今在巢湖，擁眾萬餘，處地肥饒，廬江間人多依就之，況吾徒乎？觀其形勢，又可博集，時不可失，足下速之。」肅答然其計。葬畢還曲阿，欲北行。會瑜已徙肅母到吳，肅具以狀語瑜。時孫策已薨，權尚住吳，瑜謂肅曰：「昔馬援答光武云『當今之世，非但君擇臣，臣亦擇君』。今主人親賢貴士，納奇錄異，且吾聞先哲秘論，承運代劉氏者，必興於東南，推步事勢，當其歷數，終構帝基，以協天符，是烈士攀龍附鳳馳騖之秋。吾方達此，足下不須以子揚之言介意也。」肅從其言。瑜因薦肅才宜佐時，當廣求其比，以成功業，不可令去也。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-lusu:line043:m0002","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"劉子揚","kind":"person","person_id":"6iz_lm5_o4w","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-lusu:line043:m0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"肅","kind":"person","person_id":"ooa_1fr_hy9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-lusu:line043:m0011","start":11,"end":12,"surface":"肅","kind":"person","person_id":"ooa_1fr_hy9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-lusu:line043:m0039","surface":"老母","start":39,"end":41,"kind":"person","person_id":"2yj_w0j_nit","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段具名及前後親稱、官職定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-lusu:line043:m0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"鄭寶","kind":"person","person_id":"7zg_fdu_wpe","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-lusu:line043:m0104","start":104,"end":105,"surface":"肅","kind":"person","person_id":"ooa_1fr_hy9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-lusu:line043:m0121","start":121,"end":122,"surface":"瑜","kind":"person","